WEBVTT

00:12.929 --> 00:15.306
Intruder!

00:17.016 --> 00:20.103
<i>He is Ranma of the Saotome School
of Anything Goes Martial Arts.</i>

00:23.690 --> 00:25.817
<i>She is Akane of the Tendo Dojo.</i>

00:27.110 --> 00:30.155
<i>The two of them are now engaged
due to their parents' decision.</i>

00:30.238 --> 00:31.072
- What?
- What?

00:31.156 --> 00:32.782
Don't decide who I'll marry.

00:32.866 --> 00:34.159
It's irritating.

00:36.244 --> 00:38.538
<i>And Ranma has a problem.</i>

00:39.664 --> 00:40.498
What?

00:40.582 --> 00:43.835
<i>He transforms into a girl
when he's splashed with water.</i>

00:43.918 --> 00:45.128
What the hell are you doing?

00:47.255 --> 00:48.256
Don't run away!

00:53.303 --> 00:57.557
RANMA1/2

02:25.436 --> 02:28.231
<i>Ladies and gentlemen,
thank you for your patience.</i>

02:28.314 --> 02:30.733
<i>No, perhaps we've kept you
waiting too long.</i>

02:30.817 --> 02:35.071
<i>A flower of passion in full bloom
amidst the icy gust of the skating rink.</i>

02:35.155 --> 02:38.283
<i>Truly caught between
rationality and passion.</i>

02:38.366 --> 02:41.536
<i>Flying, flying, spinning, spinning,
skating, skating and tumbling.</i>

02:42.120 --> 02:43.997
<i>Dream Flower, that's its name.</i>

02:44.080 --> 02:46.457
<i>The flower in reverie.</i>

02:47.333 --> 02:49.669
<i>The contenders clash fiercely
to grasp that dream,</i>

02:49.752 --> 02:52.422
<i>the Charlotte Cup!</i>

02:52.505 --> 02:55.925
<i>Throughout heaven and earth,
on the brink of an explosion!</i>

02:56.009 --> 02:58.011
<i>An unrivaled spectacle
that's never been seen before!</i>

02:58.094 --> 03:01.556
<i>Unheard, unsung, un-ionized.
My take, your take, no sense at all.</i>

03:01.639 --> 03:03.474
<i>At a reckless stand,
the sunburned eggplant</i>

03:03.558 --> 03:05.143
<i>is so black and ripened.</i>

03:05.226 --> 03:07.353
<i>I want to bite into it,
but I've got dentures.</i>

03:08.229 --> 03:11.941
<i>What awaits at the end of the trials and
tribulations? Victory or bitter defeat?</i>

03:12.442 --> 03:14.736
<i>Who will become
the Alexander Nevsky of our day</i>

03:14.819 --> 03:17.572
<i>and clutch the bangs
of the Goddess of Victory?</i>

03:18.072 --> 03:21.159
<i>Don't miss a single second of this match.</i>

03:21.242 --> 03:23.912
<i>Watch with unclouded eyes!</i>

03:24.704 --> 03:27.624
<i>Now, everyone,
I've kept you waiting long enough.</i>

03:27.707 --> 03:30.877
<i>It's the second half
of this frenzied Martial Skating match.</i>

03:30.960 --> 03:34.339
<i>The two unrivaled duos face off
in a showdown!</i>

03:36.674 --> 03:39.510
Unexpected developments unfold
one after another.

03:39.594 --> 03:44.098
The Martial Skating match between Kolkhoz
High School and Furinkan High School.

03:44.182 --> 03:47.018
The rink has become like
the drifting ice of the arctic.

03:47.727 --> 03:50.772
Both the male and female Furinkan
High School pair have swapped out.

03:50.855 --> 03:52.857
The match begins anew with a fresh start.

03:53.942 --> 03:56.611
<i>You've got this, Ranma, Ryoga.</i>

03:56.694 --> 03:58.321
Here we come, Mikado.

03:58.821 --> 03:59.822
Brace yourself!

04:03.993 --> 04:08.373
Charlotte, just give up
and come home with me.

04:08.998 --> 04:12.502
Come to me, pigtailed girl.
I'll catch you.

04:13.086 --> 04:16.256
Catch me if you can!

04:19.092 --> 04:22.011
<i>Crap, the damage is still lingering.</i>

04:23.721 --> 04:25.807
Why are you so angry?

04:25.890 --> 04:28.476
You were so happy when I kissed you.

04:28.559 --> 04:30.395
As if, you sleazebag!

04:30.478 --> 04:32.522
Making advances on every girl in sight.

04:32.605 --> 04:33.982
I'll never forgive you!

04:35.775 --> 04:37.986
Now I get it. So that's what it is.

04:39.696 --> 04:42.490
- You're jealous of Akane Tendo.
- What?

04:43.950 --> 04:46.411
<i>It's okay. Don't worry.</i>

04:47.120 --> 04:51.082
<i>My special talent is that
I love all women equally.</i>

04:51.582 --> 04:54.711
<i>My love for you is deeper than the ocean.</i>

05:00.383 --> 05:03.720
You are seriously deluded.

05:08.099 --> 05:09.600
Enough already!

05:09.684 --> 05:12.228
I keep telling you, I'm not Charlotte!

05:12.312 --> 05:16.149
No way! Then where did Charlotte go?

05:16.232 --> 05:18.526
- I set it free.
- What?

05:19.485 --> 05:22.572
I felt bad that it got tangled up
in this pointless game.

05:22.655 --> 05:25.241
I kept its collar as a keepsake.

05:25.825 --> 05:27.160
So forget about the pig.

05:31.080 --> 05:32.582
Don't just let go like that!

05:36.127 --> 05:37.628
Wait, why are you crying?

05:38.880 --> 05:40.006
Give it back.

05:43.217 --> 05:47.638
Give me back my Charlotte!

05:51.726 --> 05:54.145
Give it back!

06:00.777 --> 06:02.653
Man, she's so strong!

06:03.196 --> 06:05.281
Come on. Stop losing.

06:05.364 --> 06:06.365
Shut up!

06:06.449 --> 06:09.494
You're one to talk,
with that big bump on your head!

06:10.453 --> 06:12.413
- Geez.
- Ouch!

06:12.997 --> 06:15.249
Forget it. We need to come up with a plan.

06:15.333 --> 06:16.334
A plan?

06:16.417 --> 06:18.711
I hate the idea,
but we've got to cooperate.

06:20.254 --> 06:21.589
I refuse.

06:21.672 --> 06:24.217
Pairing up is one thing,
but working together?

06:24.300 --> 06:26.052
She just beat you up!

06:26.552 --> 06:28.262
And I'm not at the top of my game.

06:30.431 --> 06:32.308
We have to prioritize winning.

06:33.643 --> 06:35.019
Come closer, Ryoga.

06:35.561 --> 06:36.813
Guess I have no choice.

06:37.897 --> 06:40.691
What's this? What's happening now?

06:40.775 --> 06:43.528
The Furinkan pair
seems to be formulating a plan.

06:43.611 --> 06:46.572
What sort of battle
will they put on display for us?

06:47.365 --> 06:51.786
No! No way. You heartless jerk!

06:52.870 --> 06:55.498
What about me isn't enough?

06:55.581 --> 06:56.624
You slapped me hard--

06:56.707 --> 06:58.793
Heartless jerk,

06:58.876 --> 07:01.838
jerk, jerk--

07:01.921 --> 07:03.422
This is exactly it!

07:03.506 --> 07:06.425
You turn to violence in a heartbeat,
you total wildcat!

07:06.509 --> 07:09.220
I've had enough of you. Bye!

07:15.768 --> 07:18.229
I'm all alone again.

07:23.109 --> 07:25.653
I knew it. The only one
who will ever love me is...

07:30.032 --> 07:33.035
<i>Do you get it now, pigtailed girl?</i>

07:34.954 --> 07:37.540
I'm coming! Let me be the one
who consoles you.

07:42.587 --> 07:45.214
Are you hurt, my dearest?

07:45.298 --> 07:46.841
Mikado, my darling!

07:47.467 --> 07:48.843
You fell for it!

07:50.928 --> 07:51.846
What the...

07:53.055 --> 07:54.348
Good work.

07:55.808 --> 07:56.809
San-chan!

07:59.812 --> 08:01.814
It's payback time for earlier.

08:01.898 --> 08:03.232
Brace yourself.

08:03.816 --> 08:08.488
You two are ganging up
on a helpless little girl?

08:09.238 --> 08:10.698
That's cowardly!

08:11.407 --> 08:12.867
- She's right.
- She's right.

08:20.625 --> 08:21.626
That was too close.

08:21.709 --> 08:23.628
Hey, that was underhanded!

08:24.879 --> 08:26.255
I'm scared!

08:26.339 --> 08:29.759
Girl or not, a fight's a fight!
Sorry to do this...

08:34.222 --> 08:36.682
That hurts!

08:40.311 --> 08:44.232
What a splendid display of coordination
from the Furinkan High School pair!

08:45.024 --> 08:47.318
That was amazing! Well done.

08:51.072 --> 08:53.491
Akane praised me.

08:53.574 --> 08:55.117
"Us," you mean.

08:55.201 --> 08:56.911
No, "me."

08:56.994 --> 08:58.037
"Us."

08:58.120 --> 08:59.497
"Me."

08:59.580 --> 09:01.874
Don't celebrate just yet.

09:01.958 --> 09:03.626
- When did they...
- When did they...

09:03.709 --> 09:06.754
If that's how you want to play it,
then we won't hold back either.

09:08.214 --> 09:09.507
You won't give up, will you?

09:10.132 --> 09:12.093
Keep your eyes on me, Akane.

09:12.176 --> 09:13.928
- Here I come--
- Wait a second.

09:16.389 --> 09:17.473
What was that for?

09:17.557 --> 09:19.100
You can't win this alone.

09:19.684 --> 09:21.060
Look ahead, you two!

09:23.104 --> 09:26.274
What in the world? They're curling!

09:27.900 --> 09:30.278
A brilliant double takedown shot!

09:30.861 --> 09:32.697
Come on. Get it together!

09:32.780 --> 09:34.282
- Ouch.
- Ouch.

09:34.782 --> 09:37.243
This is your fault!
If you hadn't meddled--

09:37.326 --> 09:38.578
Shut up, you pig!

09:38.661 --> 09:39.829
What's that?

09:39.912 --> 09:42.999
Stop acting all weird
to show off to Akane.

09:43.583 --> 09:45.459
This is why you can't beat me.

09:47.753 --> 09:49.964
<i>This is why you can't beat me.</i>

09:50.047 --> 09:51.841
<i>Can't beat me.</i>

09:51.924 --> 09:53.718
<i>Can't beat me.</i>

09:53.801 --> 09:56.512
<i>Can't beat me.</i>

09:58.806 --> 09:59.974
You listening?

10:03.060 --> 10:06.897
All right then.
I'll settle my score with you right here.

10:06.981 --> 10:07.857
What?

10:11.485 --> 10:12.320
I'll show you!

10:12.403 --> 10:15.239
The one who's most suited to be with Akane

10:15.323 --> 10:16.449
is me!

10:18.701 --> 10:21.245
You fell for it! I got you now!

10:21.829 --> 10:24.081
A backdrop all the way down!

10:24.165 --> 10:25.458
That packed a punch!

10:30.129 --> 10:31.297
Thank goodness.

10:37.178 --> 10:39.513
I want my Charlotte back!

10:46.270 --> 10:47.438
I'll end you now!

10:51.734 --> 10:54.820
<i>Akane, give me strength!</i>

11:32.775 --> 11:33.776
I won.

11:35.528 --> 11:37.405
- Unbelievable!
- That was awesome!

11:37.488 --> 11:42.493
Has Mikado Sanzenin
of Kolkhoz High School reached his limit?

11:42.576 --> 11:43.577
San-chan.

11:45.079 --> 11:46.872
What a cute blanket!

11:47.373 --> 11:49.083
I'm getting cold, stupid girl!

11:49.166 --> 11:50.501
Hey, hands off my blanket!

11:50.584 --> 11:52.169
That's my line!

11:53.587 --> 11:55.923
Give me back Martine!

11:56.549 --> 11:58.509
I love you, Martine.

11:59.552 --> 12:02.596
Yes, he's completely out of commission.

12:04.140 --> 12:06.851
The victor is
the Furinkan High School pair!

12:07.643 --> 12:11.939
Unbelievable! The golden pair from Kolkhoz
High School has forfeited the match.

12:12.022 --> 12:14.775
The Furinkan High School pair
secures the victory!

12:14.859 --> 12:17.278
I won, Akane.

12:21.490 --> 12:23.367
It ain't over yet.

12:26.370 --> 12:28.414
That's some show of grit, Ranma.

12:29.206 --> 12:31.750
As much as I'd like to praise you,

12:33.002 --> 12:35.004
Akane will be mine!

12:35.963 --> 12:37.965
She isn't some cat.

12:38.048 --> 12:40.885
I can't just pass her over!

12:46.557 --> 12:47.766
I've had enough of you.

12:48.267 --> 12:50.644
This is the final straw, you scum.

12:50.728 --> 12:54.148
I can't leave Akane to
a half-baked man like you.

12:54.982 --> 12:56.859
At least she won't be dating a pig!

12:56.942 --> 12:59.361
Zip it, you trash!

13:01.947 --> 13:04.617
Go to hell!

13:08.454 --> 13:10.539
Enough is enough, you two!

13:11.040 --> 13:12.208
What the hell, Akane?

13:12.291 --> 13:14.919
Why won't you two just get along?

13:15.002 --> 13:17.546
Shut up! You stay out of it!

13:17.630 --> 13:18.923
Say what?

13:19.423 --> 13:22.927
Anyhow, it's about time you tell me
why you two are fighting.

13:23.010 --> 13:25.179
It's because Ryoga wants to--

13:25.262 --> 13:27.515
We'll have a good chat once this is over.

13:27.598 --> 13:30.559
You bastard!
What do you mean, "a good chat"?

13:31.060 --> 13:32.478
- Keep your mouth shut.
- Hey!

13:32.561 --> 13:34.230
Stop oinking, you pervy pig!

13:34.313 --> 13:35.856
I'll leave you crippled!

13:35.940 --> 13:37.691
- Say what?
- Stop fighting, I said!

13:38.484 --> 13:39.360
Got you now!

13:48.577 --> 13:49.578
Akane!

13:49.662 --> 13:51.747
Man, this is why I told you
not to interfere.

13:55.334 --> 13:56.502
Don't tell me...

13:56.585 --> 13:57.670
You can't swim?

13:58.254 --> 13:59.505
- Akane!
- Akane!

14:01.382 --> 14:02.383
What?

14:02.883 --> 14:04.260
You sure about this?

14:16.689 --> 14:19.441
<i>Akane!</i>

14:31.203 --> 14:32.246
You're awake.

14:32.329 --> 14:33.497
Are you okay?

14:33.581 --> 14:35.207
Yeah. I...

14:37.710 --> 14:38.711
Ranma?

14:39.211 --> 14:40.212
He's yours.

14:40.880 --> 14:42.256
What happened to you?

14:42.798 --> 14:44.425
Why is P-chan wet too?

14:46.093 --> 14:48.721
P-chan bit onto you
and carried you to safety.

14:48.804 --> 14:50.681
I wonder when he jumped in.

14:51.265 --> 14:52.266
Oh, wow.

14:53.100 --> 14:54.727
Thank you, P-chan.

14:57.521 --> 14:59.189
Don't forget to thank Ryoga too.

14:59.690 --> 15:02.276
He jumped in to try to save you.

15:02.860 --> 15:04.236
Speaking of, where is he?

15:04.737 --> 15:05.905
Probably went home.

15:06.906 --> 15:11.410
<i>We'll call it a draw for today
just because you're a hopeless idiot.</i>

15:30.638 --> 15:32.348
Shampoo!

15:32.932 --> 15:34.516
Ranma, I'll kill you.

15:39.229 --> 15:40.814
Ranma, I'll kill you.

15:41.315 --> 15:42.316
Shampoo.

15:43.275 --> 15:44.443
I'll kill you!

15:48.656 --> 15:49.657
Akane...

15:49.740 --> 15:50.741
It's okay.

15:51.617 --> 15:54.620
I've had enough of you!

15:57.206 --> 15:59.249
- Ranma?
- She took off.

16:03.545 --> 16:04.463
Damn it!

16:07.675 --> 16:09.301
What is up with her?

16:13.722 --> 16:15.516
Is there history between you two?

16:16.308 --> 16:17.851
Yeah, there's a lot.

16:18.519 --> 16:20.187
She sure is pretty.

16:20.270 --> 16:23.107
You buffoon, she's after my life!

16:23.190 --> 16:24.817
- Really now?
- Listen to me!

16:24.900 --> 16:25.943
Okay.

16:30.280 --> 16:33.075
<i>How could I ever forget?
It was a couple of months ago.</i>

16:33.826 --> 16:35.577
Man, I'm famished.

16:36.078 --> 16:38.539
This is the village
of the Chinese Amazons.

16:38.622 --> 16:40.916
The Chinese Amazons? What's that?

16:42.418 --> 16:45.129
The girls of this village
are incredibly strong.

16:46.588 --> 16:49.091
Look, they're having a contest of skill.

16:59.935 --> 17:03.105
A martial arts tournament
brings great honor to the winner.

17:05.065 --> 17:07.359
That girl sure is strong.

17:09.737 --> 17:10.738
FIRST PRIZE

17:10.821 --> 17:12.489
What are you eating?

17:13.699 --> 17:14.908
A pork bun.

17:24.001 --> 17:29.590
She says, "Hey you, girl and panda,
what the hell? You stole my prize!"

17:30.090 --> 17:31.008
Your prize?

17:36.388 --> 17:38.932
She says, "Today is the annual
martial arts tournament,

17:39.016 --> 17:42.102
and I just became the champion."

17:42.186 --> 17:44.772
So if I take you down,
then all's good, right?

17:52.613 --> 17:54.531
<i>Aiyaa</i>...

18:02.581 --> 18:05.000
Oh, no. She won!

18:13.842 --> 18:14.843
What now?

18:16.887 --> 18:18.347
<i>Aiyaa!</i>

18:20.140 --> 18:22.434
Weren't you two girls when it happened?

18:22.518 --> 18:23.560
Let me finish.

18:30.901 --> 18:32.820
Miss, we have to run!

18:32.903 --> 18:34.321
How come?

18:34.404 --> 18:36.990
She just gave you the Kiss of Death!

18:37.074 --> 18:38.325
Death? The Kiss of Death?

18:38.408 --> 18:41.078
The Chinese Amazons
take extreme pride in themselves.

18:43.330 --> 18:46.333
<i>Losing to an outsider
is a dishonor worse than death.</i>

18:48.293 --> 18:50.087
<i>The Kiss of Death is</i>

18:50.170 --> 18:53.132
<i>a deadly pledge
to chase you to the depths of hell</i>

18:53.215 --> 18:55.008
<i>and kill you!</i>

19:00.556 --> 19:02.474
<i>After that,</i>

19:02.558 --> 19:05.727
<i>she chased us
the entire time we were in China.</i>

19:06.436 --> 19:08.397
And that's how she ended up in Japan?

19:08.897 --> 19:10.649
Isn't that something, P-chan?

19:11.859 --> 19:14.736
Lucky for you, she's a pretty girl.

19:15.237 --> 19:17.364
How is that supposed
to make me feel better?

19:19.408 --> 19:20.409
I'm home.

19:20.492 --> 19:23.203
Ranma, you have a guest.

19:23.787 --> 19:25.706
Really? Who could it be?

19:27.666 --> 19:29.543
Mr. Saotome brought her.

19:30.043 --> 19:32.045
What have you...

19:32.129 --> 19:35.215
What the hell were you thinking, baldy?

19:35.299 --> 19:37.092
SHE FOLLOWED ME.

19:37.676 --> 19:38.677
Ranma?

19:40.721 --> 19:41.722
Hello.

19:41.805 --> 19:43.348
Hello.

19:46.768 --> 19:47.603
A guy?

19:48.187 --> 19:51.440
Sorry I'm not a girl.

19:53.192 --> 19:55.694
Is this her first time
meeting you as a boy?

19:56.361 --> 19:57.362
Ryoga.

19:57.946 --> 20:01.158
You seem to know
an awful lot about this, P-chan.

20:02.201 --> 20:04.620
Do you think you can talk to me like that?

20:05.662 --> 20:08.373
Hey! What's that for?

20:08.457 --> 20:10.876
She came all this way from China.

20:10.959 --> 20:12.586
Come on. Turn into a girl.

20:14.922 --> 20:16.048
Show me Ranma.

20:17.049 --> 20:18.050
I don't know!

20:18.133 --> 20:20.052
You hide Ranma too,

20:20.552 --> 20:22.554
and I'll kill you!

20:23.305 --> 20:24.598
Hey, knock it off.

20:24.681 --> 20:25.682
Stay out of my way!

20:26.558 --> 20:28.602
Don't make trouble in someone's house!

20:34.233 --> 20:35.651
Oh, dear.

20:35.734 --> 20:36.902
Poor girl.

20:36.985 --> 20:39.905
Looks like she lost again.

20:41.698 --> 20:44.117
It was an accident! An accident!

20:44.868 --> 20:48.705
What's wrong, Ranma?
There's no need to be humble. You won.

20:48.789 --> 20:49.873
KNOCKOUT!

20:49.957 --> 20:52.876
But it was just...

20:53.460 --> 20:57.297
Does this mean that she'll come after you
even when you're a boy?

20:57.381 --> 20:58.674
No!

21:00.342 --> 21:02.344
You didn't lose.
That was an accident! Pure luck!

21:02.427 --> 21:03.762
Booyah!

21:04.805 --> 21:07.391
Just accept her Kiss of Death.

21:15.482 --> 21:16.483
What?

21:25.993 --> 21:31.873
KISS OF DEATH

22:56.875 --> 23:01.880
Subtitle translation by:
Megumi Hunter
